  "body": "SPYTube v1.3 introduces major performance improvements and features:\n- **120fps Support**: Added support for high refresh rate displays (90Hz/120Hz).\n- **Silky Smooth Scrolling**: Added hardware layer caching and Coil memory caching to eliminate stuttering when scrolling through movies.\n- **Improved Glass UI Visibility**: Added a new dark gradient background so the liquid glass effects are clearly visible against the content.\n- **Reduced Battery & Memory Usage**: Optimized image loading and background rendering.\n- **R8 Minification**: Smaller APK size and faster launch times."
